ipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.925346,36.429828]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"山清路","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 峡谷・渓谷","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"20448","municipality_pref":"長野県","municipality_name":"生坂村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"601"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.9554901123047,36.463783264160156]}}],"display_comment_original":"生坂村周辺には、近世村の記憶として上生坂村、下生坂村、大日向村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡に関わる場所が見え、日岐大城跡、日岐城跡、日岐神社のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では上生坂村、下生坂村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の由緒を示す歴史案内板も見つかるかもしれない。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["加藤正治"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["山清路","水鳥公園","高津屋森林公園","道の駅いくさかの郷","生坂村山清路の郷資料館","やまなみ荘"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["加藤正治物語 : 日本の近代化を進めた法学者 : 東京大学名誉教授・中央大学初代総長・俳人 : マンガふるさとの偉人信州・生坂村出身 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-23692952"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E5%9D%82%E6%9D%91","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11399323","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%8A%A0%E8%97%A4%E6%AD%A3%E6%B2%BB&keyword=%E7%94%9F%E5%9D%82%E6%9D%91"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"生坂村","wikipedia_revision_id":"110696463","wikidata_qid":"Q1347517","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E5%9D%82%E6%9D%91","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%8A%A0%E8%97%A4%E6%AD%A3%E6%B2%BB&keyword=%E7%94%9F%E5%9D%82%E6%9D%91","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}